# ==============================
# Che Flockr — GLOBAL .gitignore
# ==============================
# 3-Layer Strategy ENGINEERING-CONTRACTS §6.2:
#   - VERSIONED in repo (WHITELIST): commands/ contracts/ skills/ hooks/ scripts/ permission/
#     + root docs (README, CHE_*, REFERENCE_*, package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml, tsconfig.json, hooks.json)
#   - TOTALLY IGNORED (BLACKLIST): per-machine / per-user data — NEVER overwritten by git pull

# ===== .trae internals from Trae IDE =====
builtin/
builtin_skills/
mcps/
trae-browser-screenshots/
toolhost/
memory-config.json
skill-config.json

# ===== ABSOLUTE BLACKLIST: per-machine data (user-specific) =====
memory/
#   Level 1 local binding — each local session. Single writer = contracts helper.
bindings/registry.jsonl

#   User's personal rules (profile, language, preferences, per-session flags).
#   Use user_rules/.gitkeep to maintain empty folder structure in repo.
user_rules/*
!user_rules/.gitkeep

# ===== DEPS & GENERATED ARTIFACTS =====
node_modules/
pnpm-debug.log*

# ===== Backups from install-che.sh (~/.trae.bak-YYYYMMDD-HHMM) =====
*.bak-*
*.bak

# ===== Editor / OS =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ===== Runtime logs =====
*.log

# ====== CHE PLANNING ARTIFACTS — NEVER COMMIT ======
# (Fail-closed: even if a legacy skill bug creates these files
#  INSIDE the che-ai repo instead of $CHE_WORKSPACES_ROOT, git
#  won't stage them. Client projects receive the complete snippet via
#  contracts/che-planning-artifacts-blacklist.gitignore injected
#  into .gitignore by install-che.sh / self-update-che.sh.)
.trae/
!.trae/.gitkeep
decisions.log.jsonl
decisions.log.md
decision.log.jsonl
decision.log.md
task_graph.md
manual_test_plan.md
final_summary.md
execution_batches.md
batch_execution_report.md
merge_audit.md
merge_audit.jsonl
scope-report.md
scope_check_report.md
spec_*.md
gh_stack_plan.md
session.md
envelope.md
graphify-out/
che-review-report.md
che-compliance-report.md
flockr-review-report.md
__pycache__/
